# Oracle: closure lift must not shift lines below the literal (the call-site
# collapse is padded line-neutral), and an error INSIDE a hoisted closure
# body must map to the USER file:line, not a synthetic <cc-closures> file.
# Pin file:line:col + symbol; clang wording varies.
diag_oracle_closure_fail.ccs:13:17: error:
cc_diag_oracle_undeclared_two
diag_oracle_closure_fail.ccs:10:21: error:
cc_diag_oracle_undeclared
